      "side": 1,
      "message": "In testing we found that GetMaximumAllocationSize() was reporting 16Mb, which was well above the limit where this method began showing gains, so I\u0027ve kept it as a static 4Mb here (which proved to be a reasonable cutoff point on every device I tested, mobile or desktop).",
